  "description": "As a clean freak and germophobe, it was only natural for Seon-Gyeol to start a cleaning company. What he doesn't anticipate, however, is the messy girl who crash-lands in his life as a new employee. O-Sol is a cheery rookie who doesn't mind getting dirty but is unfortunately terrible at cleaning. Although she and Seon-Gyeol are polar opposites, fate seems to keep drawing them together in the most hilarious ways. Can O-Sol get Seon-Gyeol to open up his heart and help him overcome his extreme germophobia?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes 24 extra chapters.*",
